# Class-table features are rules text unless an explicit PCGen numeric grant is present.
Eliciter Persuasive (Reference)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DEFINE:SPHERES_ELICITER_PERSUASIVE|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_ELICITER_PERSUASIVE|2+floor(SPHERES_ELICITER_LEVEL/6)	DESC:%SPHERES_ELICITER_PERSUASIVE bonus to Mind sphere and eliciter DCs, Bluff, Diplomacy and Intimidate; apply to qualifying rolls or uses only.
Eliciter Hypnotism Uses (Reference)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DEFINE:SPHERES_ELICITER_HYPNOTISM_USES|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_ELICITER_HYPNOTISM_USES|3+floor(SPHERES_ELICITER_LEVEL/2)	DESC:%SPHERES_ELICITER_HYPNOTISM_USES uses per day; DC includes the persuasive bonus; apply to qualifying rolls or uses only.
